  "text": "\tdanpiths\nFollow\nOverview\nRepositories\n27\nProjects\nPackages\nStars\n61\nSponsoring\n3\n\tdanpiths\t\nFollow\n🔨\nbuilding shit\nDan Piths\ndanpiths\nFollow\ni don't drink coffee. Full Stack Developer - Typescript (@t3dotgg 🛐) | Next.js | tRPC | Prisma | @shadcn /ui | @clerkinc\n 18 followers · 24 following\nSponsoring\nAchievements\nx4\nx3\nBlock or report user\ndanpiths/README.md\nhi, i’m dan :)\n\naka dhwanil pithva\n\nweb developer (fullstack)\n🪂 never afraid to dive into anything new and rewrite the whole code base if it’s worth it\n🚀 aiming to ship shit faster that is performant and has a good ui\n🩸 “bleed responsibly” - Theo\n🎓 “best way to learn is to build shit” - Also Theo\n🗿 average T3 mindset enjoyer\ntech i strongly recommend and use\n            \n\n\n\ns/o Theo Browne\n\nThis man made me a better developer and i learned a lot from him, definitely recommend you check him out.\n\n  \nPinned\nLoading\n todos-next-13 Public\n\nA basic todos app, made using Next.js 13 and Drizzle ORM\n\n TypeScript\n\n t3-twitter-clone Public\n\nA Twitter Clone created using the T3 Stack\n\n TypeScript\n\n Canteen-Frontend Public\n\nAn app to try and streamline the process of ordering food from our canteen.\n\n JavaScript\n\n Canteen-Backend Public\n\nBackend for CanteenWala App.\n\n JavaScript\n\n dink Public\n\nAn app to keep track of me and my friends' dinner and milk expenses :)\n\n JavaScript\n\n Pacman Public\n\nA minimal Pacman game that you can play on your browser\n\n JavaScript  1",
